SyncFu
Copyright 2026 SyncFu contributors

SyncFu is independently implemented. Its design research references
Oink (https://github.com/oinkvm/oink) and Syncthing
(https://github.com/syncthing/syncthing). Their source code and assets are not
included in SyncFu. Third-party dependency notices accompany distributions.

Current desktop UI

The existing application adapts desktop conventions from tauri-ui
(https://github.com/agmmnn/tauri-ui; author agmmnn; upstream package declares
MIT). tauri-ui is a scaffolder, not a runtime component dependency.

Vendored shadcn/ui components are adapted for SyncFu and use Radix primitives.
shadcn/ui: Copyright (c) 2023 shadcn, MIT License.
See assets/licenses/ and docs/ui/ for source records.

Microsoft Fluent Emoji 3D device artwork is used without modification.
Copyright (c) Microsoft Corporation, MIT License.
Source URLs and content hashes: assets/fluent-emoji/sources.json.
License: assets/fluent-emoji/LICENSE.txt.

The current interface also uses Lucide for device types and actions,
Phosphor for state icons, react-file-icon for file types, and Inter for
Latin typography. Their licenses and notices remain with the dependency
distributions and the local assets/ license records.

BoardUI, Morphicons and EasyUI notices remain for the earlier implementations
and historical source retained in this repository. They do not identify the
current desktop runtime's component selection.
